{
 "id": "SE-F034",
 "level": "security",
 "title": "a backslash anywhere in a URL is refused (media and remote_text_encoder.url)",
 "note": "Validate only, as the prose demands: no probe is ever run. (d), the percent-encoded backslash, is 'recorded, not judged': the report has nowhere to record it, so it is not sent. (e) uses templates/image-to-image, one of the image-conditioned templates list_workflows(shape='image-edit') lists. The (f) carrier and the control are SE-F009's shape: a pipeline with configuration, from_pretrained_arguments and arguments, plus the remote_text_encoder block. 'Names the backslash or an invalid URL' is either word in any of the answer's error messages.",
 "steps": [
  {
   "label": "(a) the plan's probe, as a task argument",
   "call": "validate_workflow",
   "args": {
    "workflow": {
     "id": "contract-se-f034",
     "steps": [
      {
       "name": "s",
       "task": {
        "command": "get_image_size",
        "arguments": {
         "image": "http://169.254.169.254\\@example.com/a.png"
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "expect": [
    {
     "path": "valid",
     "eq": false
    },
    {
     "path": "errors",
     "any_contains": [
      "\"path\": \"steps[0].task.arguments.image\""
     ]
    },
    {
     "path": "errors[*].message",
     "contains_any": [
      "backslash",
      "nvalid URL"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "label": "(b) a backslash in the authority with no @",
   "call": "validate_workflow",
   "args": {
    "workflow": {
     "id": "contract-se-f034",
     "steps": [
      {
       "name": "s",
       "task": {
        "command": "get_image_size",
        "arguments": {
         "image": "https://huggingface.co\\evil.example/x.png"
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "expect": [
    {
     "path": "valid",
     "eq": false
    },
    {
     "path": "errors",
     "any_contains": [
      "\"path\": \"steps[0].task.arguments.image\""
     ]
    },
    {
     "path": "errors[*].message",
     "contains_any": [
      "backslash",
      "nvalid URL"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "label": "(c) a backslash in the path only",
   "call": "validate_workflow",
   "args": {
    "workflow": {
     "id": "contract-se-f034",
     "steps": [
      {
       "name": "s",
       "task": {
        "command": "get_image_size",
        "arguments": {
         "image": "https://example.com/a\\b.png"
        }
